<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Voucher {{ voucher.code }} — DreamTravel</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { margin: 0; padding: 24px; background: #f6f7fb; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1d2233; }
        .ticket { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border: 2px dashed #b8892d; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; }
        .ticket-head { background: #b8892d; color: #fff; padding: 18px 28px; }
        .ticket-head .brand { font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        .ticket-head .sub { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; opacity: .9; }
        .ticket-body { padding: 28px; }
        .remise { font-size: 56px; font-weight: bold; color: #b8892d; line-height: 1; }
        .remise small { font-size: 18px; color: #1d2233; font-weight: normal; }
        .code { display: inline-block; margin-top: 18px; padding: 10px 18px; border: 1px solid #e4e7ef; border-radius: 8px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 3px; background: #fbf6ea; }
        table.infos { width: 100%; margin-top: 24px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; }
        table.infos td { padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eef0f5; }
        table.infos td.label { color: #6b7280; width: 45%; }
        .statut { display: inline-block; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; }
        .statut.ok { background: #e8f5ee; color: #0f5132; }
        .statut.used { background: #eef0f5; color: #6b7280; }
        .note { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.6; }
        .actions { max-width: 720px; margin: 18px auto 0; display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; border: 1px solid #b8892d; }
        .btn-primary { background: #b8892d; color: #fff; }
        .btn-outline { background: #fff; color: #b8892d; }
        @media print { body { background: #fff; padding: 0; } .actions { display: none; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="ticket">
        <div class="ticket-head">
            <div class="brand">DREAMTRAVEL</div>
            <div class="sub">Voucher fidélité — Remise sur votre prochaine réservation</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ticket-body">
            <div class="remise">-{{ voucher.pourcentage }}&nbsp;% <small>sur votre prochaine réservation</small></div>
            <div class="code">{{ voucher.code }}</div>

            <table class="infos">
                <tr><td class="label">Titulaire</td><td>{{ voucher.client.nomComplet }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="label">Email</td><td>{{ voucher.client.email }}</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="label">Émis le</td><td>{{ voucher.createdAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}</td></tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Statut</td>
                    <td>
                        {% if voucher.utilise %}
                            <span class="statut used">Utilisé — réservation {{ voucher.reservation.reference }}</span>
                        {% else %}
                            <span class="statut ok">Disponible</span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <p class="note">
                Ce voucher est enregistré sur votre compte DreamTravel : vous n'avez rien à saisir.
                La remise est appliquée <strong>automatiquement</strong> sur le prix total de votre prochaine réservation.
                Si cette réservation est annulée, le voucher redevient disponible.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    {% if not pourPdf %}
    <div class="actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" onclick="window.print()">Imprimer / Enregistrer en PDF</button>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="{{ path('profil_reservations') }}">Mes réservations</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="{{ path('app_voyages') }}">Réserver un voyage</a>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
</body>
</html>
